  "category": "structural",
  "severity": "medium",
  "status": "proven_mitigated",
  "summary": "Agents have no awareness of their infrastructure state. When GPU throttles, RAM fills, or network times out, the agent misattributes the failure as a code bug and hallucinates fixes.",
  "mechanism": "The agent's context contains no hardware telemetry. When a tool call times out due to network congestion, the agent reasons about code bugs because that's the only explanation in its context.",
  "blast_radius": "Cascading incorrect diagnoses. Wasted effort on phantom bugs.",
  "prerequisite": "Agent without infrastructure telemetry in context.",
